    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="struct_monomial_table_1_1mon__term" kindref="compound">MonomialTable::mon_term</ref></computeroutput> plus an <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_monomial_table_z_z_1_1mon__term_a4b78dc3344300423705d7dbc380243bd_1a4b78dc3344300423705d7dbc380243bd" kindref="member">_coeff</ref></computeroutput> slot pointing at the entry&apos;s leading <computeroutput><ref refid="ringelem_8hpp_afea72c39052b53d15e7acad8d36847c1_1afea72c39052b53d15e7acad8d36847c1" kindref="member">ZZ</ref></computeroutput> coefficient (or <computeroutput>nullptr</computeroutput> for the coefficient-blind case). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The coefficient itself is owned by whatever stored the entry (typically a GB element), so the lifetime of <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_monomial_table_z_z_1_1mon__term_a4b78dc3344300423705d7dbc380243bd_1a4b78dc3344300423705d7dbc380243bd" kindref="member">_coeff</ref></computeroutput> must outlive this <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_monomial_table_z_z_1_1mon__term" kindref="compound">mon_term</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
